{"game": "roboquest", "language": "english", "appid": 692890, "month": "2021-04", "window": 4, "start_date": 1619136000, "end_date": 1619827199, "month_true_total": 125, "quota": 5, "returned": 5, "pulled_at": "2026-10-03 01:48:48 UTC", "reviews": [{"recommendationid": "91189930", "author": {"steamid": "76561198257365479", "personaname": "hobueesel", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561198257365479/", "num_games_owned": 1686, "num_reviews": 155, "playtime_forever": 789, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 233, "last_played": 1735295955, "avatar": "53cbc3bc9c3f49d9b7667c60354cc634328e6190"}, "language": "english", "review": "They have really done an amazing job with the game and with 1.0 launch it feels great, plays great and is really enjoyable on controller. Was a well worth early access.\n\n\nOriginal review >>\n------\nIt's a tricky vote. During these few hours of play i've put in right now there was almost never any moment where i felt. Omg this build is so op. As such it's not really a roguelike but a well made balanced shooter. My controllerhands just felt numb after grinding through these countless enemies and beating the no effort first boss, then again grinding countless enemies until you just don't care anymore because every next enemy is just the same as the previous one and there is nothing to look forward to. I'm definitely going to check out the next game from the same dev though as it's a great start. It's just a bit too boring and underwhelming in regards of synergies.", "timestamp_created": 1619815364, "timestamp_updated": 1699983340, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": "0.529183924198150635", "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": false, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": true, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1597939791", "reactions": [{"reaction_type": 19, "count": 1}, {"reaction_type": 4, "count": 1}]}, {"recommendationid": "91172859", "author": {"steamid": "76561198062689628", "personaname": "J1019", "persona_status": "online", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/id/J1019-X/", "num_games_owned": 378, "num_reviews": 10, "playtime_forever": 665, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 418, "last_played": 1623920199, "avatar": "0e96fd1da4c91017a7c1de980d6361b139e6831d"}, "language": "english", "review": "Despite being rather slow on development and still in early access this game is great!\nI haven't gotten further than the forth world with a friend but its kept me entertained for 6 hours.", "timestamp_created": 1619793964, "timestamp_updated": 1619793964, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 1, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": "0.507936537265777588", "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": true, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1597939791", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "91141616", "author": {"steamid": "76561198085143417", "personaname": "Blacksmith", "persona_status": "online", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561198085143417/", "num_games_owned": 0, "num_reviews": 12, "playtime_forever": 628, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 334, "last_played": 1699582756, "avatar": "d68fd4dd8a41d40d58c76a0b93e1597052ab805b"}, "language": "english", "review": "IS GOOD", "timestamp_created": 1619739446, "timestamp_updated": 1619739446, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": true, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1597939791", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "91106964", "author": {"steamid": "76561198811829581", "personaname": "Muscle man", "persona_status": "in-game", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com